    { "type": "text", "id": "q2", "label": "Q2", "default": "Which clubs count?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a2", "label": "A2", "default": "Every club we make. Mix lofts, Gold and Black, a putter, the Stryker. Two clubs is $50 off, three or more is $100 off." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q3", "label": "Q3", "default": "Where's my towel and divot tool?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a3", "label": "A3", "default": "In the box with your clubs. Postcard orders get them with any club. From Nov 24 it takes two or more clubs. One set per order, while they last." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a3_gone", "label": "A3 once gifts are gone", "default": "They're all gone. The $50 and $100 off are still on." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q4", "label": "Q4", "default": "Is shipping free?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a4", "label": "A4", "default": "On anything $[ship] and up, so every three-club order ships free." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q5", "label": "Q5", "default": "Does it stack with other codes?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a5", "label": "A5", "default": "One code per order. This one beats the others anyway." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q6", "label": "Q6", "default": "When does it end?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a6", "label": "A6", "default": "Cyber Monday, Nov 30, at midnight Central." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q7", "label": "Q7", "default": "What if it doesn't work out?" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a7", "label": "A7", "default": "Every club gets sixty days from delivery. Talk to us before anything ships back, because club returns need our OK and a few photos first. Return shipping's on you." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "q8", "label": "Q8" },
